  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "[English](README.md) · [中文](README.zh.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Code Review (Alibaba OpenCodeReview) · DSH plugin",
      "text": "Run a real review of the changes you just made with [Alibaba OpenCodeReview](https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review), and get the result back **as it is** — what was covered, which model answered, and why it failed."
    },
    {
      "section": "Code Review (Alibaba OpenCodeReview) · DSH plugin",
      "text": "- **No separate `ocr` install.** The binary ships with the plugin (Windows x64).\n- **No API key to configure.** The review uses the model **your current conversation is already using**, forwarded through a loopback-only bridge inside DSH (your key never enters the `ocr` child process).\n- **Verifiable conclusions.** Every review carries a coverage receipt: which hunks were included, which files were excluded, and which parts have no conclusion."
    },
    {
      "section": "30-second start",
      "text": "1. Install (skip if already installed):\n   ```bash\n   dsh plugin --profile <your profile> add github:xinyangGL/dsh-open-code-review\n   ```\n2. After you change code, click **“启动代码审核”** at the end of the turn. Its sub-line states the cost first: `N files changed this turn · ocr tier: ~3–10 min/file, billed by tokens`.\n3. Read the result. Other entry points:"
    },
    {
      "section": "30-second start",
